<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Suppression de votre projet</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            background: #f0ede8;
            color: #2d2a25;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 580px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* ── HEADER ── */
        .header {
            background: #1a1815;
            padding: 40px 48px 36px 48px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50px; right: -50px;
            width: 180px; height: 180px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 40px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        }

        .header-label {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #c4a97d;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #faf8f5;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .header-divider {
            width: 36px;
            height: 1px;
            background: #c4a97d;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        /* ── BODY ── */
        .body {
            background: #faf8f5;
            padding: 44px 48px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #2d2a25;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .intro {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #4a4640;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .project-name {
            color: #1a1815;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* ── ALERT BOX ── */
        .alert {
            background: #f5f0e8;
            border-left: 3px solid #c4a97d;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .alert-label {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #b89a72;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .alert-reason {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2d2a25;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .alert-details-label {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #b89a72;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .alert-details {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #4a4640;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* ── META ── */
        .meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8a8078;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            padding: 16px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8e2da;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e2da;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .meta span {
            color: #4a4640;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* ── CLOSING ── */
        .closing {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #4a4640;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .signature {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #2d2a25;
        }

        .signature-name {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #c4a97d;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        .footer {
            background: #1a1815;
            padding: 20px 48px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #5a5650;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-label">Path2Learn · Portfolio</div>
        <div class="header-title">Notification de<br>suppression de projet</div>
        <div class="header-divider"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- BODY -->
    <div class="body">

        <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ student_name }},</p>

        <p class="intro">
            Nous vous informons que votre projet
            <span class="project-name">"{{ project_title }}"</span>
            a été supprimé de la plateforme Portfolio.
        </p>

        <!-- ALERT -->
        <div class="alert">
            <div class="alert-label">Raison de la suppression</div>
            <div class="alert-reason">{{ reason }}</div>
            {% if details %}
            <div class="alert-details-label">Détails supplémentaires</div>
            <div class="alert-details">{{ details }}</div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <!-- DATE -->
        <div class="meta">
            Action effectuée le <span>{{ date|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</span>
        </div>

        <p class="closing">
            Si vous pensez qu'il s'agit d'une erreur, veuillez contacter l'administrateur du système.
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            Cordialement,
            <div class="signature-name">L'équipe Portfolio</div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement — merci de ne pas y répondre</p>
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>